Changes of the Raku package "Data::Transformers".

2026-10-24 0.0.4
    - Implemented &standardize
        - Uses standard deviation via the package "Stats" which use @data.elems denominator
            - Instead of (@data.elems - 1)
        - Works only on lists of numbers and lists of lists of numbers
            - I.e. should be generalized on "deeper" arrays
        - The center and scale arguments can be numbers, callables, or Whatever.

2026-09-29 0.0.3
    - Fixes of inconsistent rescale formulas.

2026-08-31 0.0.2
    - Made &array-pad use lower case and hyphenated names for the padding rules.
        - Following closer the specs of Wolfram Language's PadLeft and PadRight.
    - Made &rescale work with Bag/Hash/Mix objects.

2026-08-22 0.0.1
    - First version with &array-pad, &center-array, and &rescale.